  Max out-degree: 6 (at class 0)


7. TRANSFER MATRIX — RANDOM WALK ON G_5
------------------------------------------------------------

  RANDOM WALK on G_5:
  Transition matrix eigenvalues:
    λ_0 = 1.000000
    λ_1 = 0.467822
    λ_2 = 0.324220
    λ_3 = 0.218218
    λ_4 = 0.073096
    λ_5 = 0.006820

  Spectral gap: 1 - λ_1 = 0.532178
  Mixing time ≈ 1/(1-λ_1) ≈ 1.9 steps

  STATIONARY DISTRIBUTION (proportional to degree):
