  E[H] under uniform on tournaments: 15/2


8. MOMENTS OF H ON G_5
------------------------------------------------------------

  WEIGHTED BY CLASS SIZE (= tournament-level moments):
    E[H] = 7.5000
    E[H²] = 74.0625
    Var(H) = 17.8125

  UNWEIGHTED (each class equal):
    E[H] = 7.6667
    E[H²] = 81.6667
    Var(H) = 22.8889

  The weighted E[H] = 7.50 is the TRUE average.
  The unweighted E[H] = 7.67 OVERWEIGHTS rare classes.
  Difference: 0.17 — the rare (high-symmetry) classes
  pull the unweighted mean toward HIGHER H.


